{"availability":"available","full":"jailsonsb2/bottom_radioplayer","name":"bottom_radioplayer","description":"🎵 Bottom-bar radio player component — the audio NEVER stops while visitors browse your site (seamless navigation). YouTube clip mode + full site demo. Player de rádio fixo no rodapé que não para ao navegar.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":7,"forks":2,"created":"2024-08-07T23:07:07Z","updated":"2026-07-26T15:10:10Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://jailsonsb2.github.io/bottom_radioplayer/","topics":["azuracast","footer-player","html5","html5-radio-player","icecast","javascript","now-playing","player-de-radio","pwa","radio","radio-online","radio-player","radio-streaming","seamless-navigation","shoutcast","streaming","web-component","webradio","youtube","zeno-fm"],"demo":"https://jailsonsb2.github.io/bottom_radioplayer/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:37.608Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:37.608Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:37.608Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T13:58:37.608Z","stars":7,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["▶ Try the live demo — click play, then navigate between the pages: the music never stops.","A bottom-bar HTML5 radio player that works as a drop-in JavaScript component: two script tags inject the whole player (HTML, CSS and fonts) into any page of your site. With seamless navigation enabled (default), clicks on internal links are intercepted and only the page content is swapped — the audio keeps playing without any interruption while visitors browse your site.","🇧🇷 Player de rádio fixo no rodapé que NÃO PARA quando o visitante navega pelo site. Duas linhas de código em cada página e pronto: música tocando agora com capa, histórico, letra, clipe do YouTube sincronizado e um site demo completo (notícias, vídeos, programação, equipe) configurável sem tocar em código."],"features":["Embeddable component — no HTML to copy; the player injects itself.","Uninterrupted audio across pages — internal navigation swaps content without reloading (SPA-lite), so the stream never stops.","Playback state persistence — station, playing state and volume survive full page loads; playback auto-resumes (or resumes on the first tap when the browser blocks autoplay).","Audio playback with play/pause, volume and station switching, plus smooth volume fade in/out (no audio \"pop\").","Loading spinner while the stream buffers and automatic reconnection with backoff when the network drops."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jailsonsb2/bottom_radioplayer/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9b70c4e7412f3f892335402c30bc6e46f96df9a592d716e472593f322f046d88","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:37.735Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:37.735Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"▶ Try the live demo — click play, then navigate between the pages: the music never stops.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jailsonsb2/bottom_radioplayer/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"Lyrics via lyrics.ovh with LRCLIB fallback — no API key required, with request caching.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jailsonsb2/bottom_radioplayer/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Links to /wp-admin/ and wp-login.php are always excluded automatically — WordPress's admin area isn't part of the site's front-end layout.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jailsonsb2/bottom_radioplayer/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"9b70c4e7412f3f892335402c30bc6e46f96df9a592d716e472593f322f046d88","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jailsonsb2/bottom_radioplayer/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:37.735Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-07-26T15:10:10Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jailsonsb2/bottom_radioplayer/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:37.736Z","hash":"9b